# HeroLower v22

Built-in image generation edited v21 independent coverage: keep inward-facing crowns crisp and all distant banks unchanged; broaden the outward hero underside transition inward, soften deep notches, and retain unequal broad rounded density forms without a white shelf or flat baseline. Upper-right bank southwest side faces the UV center; northeast side fades.

Generated_Coverage.png is the selected built-in result. Packaging blends selected partial-opacity hero pixels at 65% into the v15 baseline. RGB and fully opaque crown pixels are unchanged. Generated source 1254 square; packed output 4096 square is upscaled.

Applied for review in the existing unsaved Untitled_1 map. Superseded by FarEdge_v26, which retains this underside edit.
